---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';import {getStore} from '../data/providers';import {money,url} from '../lib/format';
export function getStaticPaths(){return ['about','contact','faq','shipping','privacy','terms','account'].map(page=>({params:{page}}));}
const {page}=Astro.params;const {settings}=await getStore();const titles:Record<string,string>={about:'Every detail has a story.',contact:'Good conversations start here.',faq:'A few things you might be wondering.',shipping:'From our hands to yours.',privacy:'Your information, thoughtfully handled.',terms:'The details that matter.',account:'Your Beltaly corner.'};
---
<Layout title={titles[page!]} noindex={page==='account'}><article class="wrap prose"><p class="eyebrow">BELTALY / {page?.toUpperCase()}</p><h1>{titles[page!]}</h1>
{page==='about'&&<><p>We believe the smallest detail can bring an outfit together. Beltaly is a belt and leather goods company, beginning with considered belts for everyday wear. Wallets are our next chapter, coming soon.</p><h2>Crafted leather. Modern India.</h2><p>Quiet colours. Warm brass. An everyday ease that moves from office mornings to wedding evenings. Our design takes its cues from the belt itself: a continuous line, honest stitching, and a buckle that brings it all together.</p><p>This preview contains illustrative products and original SVG mock-ups. Manufacturing origins, material certifications, fulfilment promises and real product photography will be published once verified by the owner.</p><a class="btn" href={url('/shop/')}>Find your everyday ↗</a></>}
{page==='contact'&&<><p>Questions about fit, an order or a gift? WhatsApp is our main contact channel.</p>{settings.whatsapp?<a class="btn" href={`https://wa.me/${settings.whatsapp}`}>Start a WhatsApp conversation ↗</a>:<div class="account-panel"><h3>We’re getting ready.</h3><p>The store’s WhatsApp number has not been added yet. Ordering is unavailable until the owner completes setup.</p></div>}<h2>Before you message.</h2><p>For product questions, include the product name and preferred size. For existing orders, include your BLT reference. Never share a UPI PIN, OTP or card details.</p></>}
{page==='faq'&&<>{[['How do I choose a size?','Start with your trouser waist plus 2 inches, or measure a belt from buckle pin to the most-used hole. See our size guide.'],['Are the displayed prices tax inclusive?','Yes. INR prices include all applicable taxes. Shipping and optional COD fees are shown separately in the bag.'],['Is my order confirmed when I click WhatsApp?','No. The message is an order request. The store confirms stock, delivery, the final amount and acceptance.'],['Does this site verify UPI payments?','No. The store must check its own bank or payment dashboard before marking a payment received. A screenshot is not proof of settlement.'],['When are wallets coming?','Our wallet collection is coming soon. Follow Beltaly announcements or contact the store for updates.'],['Do I need an account?','No. The current store saves your bag in this browser and does not operate an account database.']].map(([q,a])=><details><summary>{q}</summary><p>{a}</p></details>)}<p><a class="text-link" href={url('/size-guide/')}>Open the size guide ↗</a></p></>}
{page==='shipping'&&<><p class="account-panel">Sample policy for owner review. The store must publish verified dispatch times, return windows, pickup conditions and refund timelines before accepting orders.</p><h2>Delivery areas & fees.</h2><p>Delivery is currently limited to pincodes listed in the delivery checker. Standard shipping is {money(settings.shippingFee)}, free on orders of {money(settings.freeShippingAbove)} or more. COD adds {money(settings.codCharge)} where available. These charges appear before you prepare an order request.</p><h2>Delivery estimates.</h2><p>The owner will confirm dispatch and delivery estimates on WhatsApp before accepting the request. There is no automated courier tracking in this preview.</p><h2>Returns & exchanges.</h2><p>Contact the store before sending an item back. Keep the order reference, packaging and photographs of any issue. Return eligibility and the refund process must be confirmed with the owner. This sample text does not establish a published return period.</p></>}
{page==='privacy'&&<><p>This static preview stores bag contents and your language preference in browser localStorage. You can remove these through your browser’s site settings. No analytics or advertising trackers are included in this project.</p><h2>Checkout information.</h2><p>Your name, phone and delivery address stay in page memory while preparing a request. Choosing WhatsApp includes them in a message URL sent to WhatsApp; you decide whether to send the message. UPI links contain the payment amount, payee and order reference. Payment link providers handle their own payment pages.</p><h2>Third parties.</h2><p>The hosting provider processes normal web requests. Remote image hosts, WhatsApp, UPI apps and payment providers apply their own privacy policies. When a live stock refresh endpoint is enabled, your browser requests that endpoint.</p><p>The owner must add its legal identity, privacy contact, retention periods and the applicable customer rights process before launch.</p></>}
{page==='terms'&&<><p>This is a demonstration catalogue. All product descriptions, images and prices are samples and must be verified before commercial use.</p><h2>Order requests & payments.</h2><p>A client-generated BLT reference identifies a request; it is not an invoice, stock reservation or acceptance of an order. The store must explicitly accept requests and verify payments independently. Prices and stock in static pages reflect the latest rebuild and may change before acceptance.</p><h2>Store information.</h2><p>The owner must publish its registered business name, address, contact details, GST information where applicable, final delivery and return policies, and customer grievance contact before launch.</p><p>This sample page requires business-specific review before publication as the store’s final terms.</p></>}
{page==='account'&&<><div class="account-panel"><h3>A simpler kind of shopping.</h3><p id="account-state">Loading account details…</p><a class="btn" href={url('/cart/')}>Open your bag ↗</a></div><p>For order updates and support, keep your WhatsApp conversation and BLT reference handy.</p></>}
</article></Layout>
